{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030150021957-1030_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261030143917\"/><p>無人良品App的用戶資料可能外洩。</p><p>日本零售品牌「無印良品」的母公司良品計劃周五（30日）公布，官方應用程式MUJI App遭到外部非法訪問，可能有多達2,726萬條客戶資訊外洩。</p><p>可能洩漏的個人資訊包括電子郵件地址、出生日期及性別，已註銷帳戶用戶的資訊也可能受影響。洩漏的資訊中不包含信用卡資料、姓名、住址或電話號碼等。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:31:33.110512+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:00:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:38.464730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:21:41.488569+00:00","content_hash":"4ffb941702d7bd373a9d09b1d217af9f5f77d0bae3cf375baf2315492fde113e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}